<title>USA: LodgeNet to supply service to Holiday Inn.</title>
<headline>LodgeNet to supply service to Holiday Inn.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS, S.D. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>LodgeNet Entertainment Corp said Wednesday it reached an agreement with Holiday Inn Worldwide that will bring the LodgeNet interactive television entertainment system to franchised Holiday Inn guest rooms in North America.</p>
<p>As part of the agreement, LodgeNet will provide Holiday Inn guests with its Guest Pay interactive services, including Guest Scheduled movies-on-demand and network-based Super Nintendo video games.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
